      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clarks_Hill%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Stevens Creek Heritage Preserve, located two miles east of Clarks Hill, is a recognized National Register of Natural Landmarks.",
